@startuml loading
!pragma layout smetana
top to bottom direction
!include _style.iuml
title How a skill loads (progressive disclosure)

rectangle "Level 1: metadata\nname + description of every skill\nabout 100 tokens each, always loaded" as L1
rectangle "User request matches a description\n(or the user types /skill-name)" as M
rectangle "Level 2: SKILL.md body\nloaded on trigger, under 5k tokens" as L2
rectangle "Level 3: resources\nreferences/ read, scripts/ run,\nassets/ copied, only when needed" as L3

L1 --> M : model decides
M --> L2 : reads SKILL.md
L2 -right-> L3 : on demand
@enduml
